    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12464" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδιαιτάω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pronounce in</i> one's <i>favour in an
			arbitration,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταδιαιτάω</span>
			(q. v.), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπως τὴν δίαιταν αὐτῷ
				ἀποδιαιτήσομεν</span> Test. ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.93
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				96
			</span></i>: hence <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τινός</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν δίκην</span>) <i>decide for</i>
			one, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				40.17
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἀποδιαιτηθέντα μου
			λύσας</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				43
			</span></i>.</div>
